Description: MyGO cross platform wallpaper tool
 Wallpaper GUI app powered by mygo(govcl).
 Support Bing public API, private wallpaper API, MTphotos API.
 Support GXDE/DDE, Debian, XinChuang(Kylin/UOS).
 Features: auto wallpaper rotation, preview, log viewer.
